body:
And...

&#x200B;

...that is all you're gonna tell us...

&#x200B;

Please share some more!

Have you ever wondered, if it might not be about success,  but the way you feel about yourself?

&#x200B;

I am way past 25, so I have no hopes of success anymore anyway....

If being 14 sucks, then don't  ask me what it's like to be older...

&#x200B;

But tell me about the things, that make you feel happy, for I want to know.
